  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/09/IMG_20200919_185521.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>La vesprada d&#39;aquest dissabte, 19 de setembre, al camp municipal de l&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic. Despr&eacute;s de l&#39;acte oficial s&#39;ha jugat una partit contra l&#39;equip de Tercera Divisi&oacute; C.D. Roda, que ha guanyat 2-5. El club Esportiu Vila d&#39;Onda jugar&agrave; per primera vegada a la Regional Preferent.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencevilaonda2021/img_20200919_185518.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200919_185518\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencevilaonda2021/img_20200919_185521.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200919_185521\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencevilaonda2021/img_20200919_185604.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200919_185604\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencevilaonda2021/img_20200919_193514.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200919_193514\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencevilaonda2021/img_20200919_193554.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200919_193554\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencevilaonda2021/img_20200919_193638.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200919_193638\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencevilaonda2021/img_20200919_193652.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200919_193652\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencevilaonda2021/img_20200919_193738.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200919_193738\" style=\"max-width:100%;hei